<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Clariant.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Clariant registered shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    700.00 CHF		PREMIUM	9.91 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.72 CHF		  GEARING	10.39 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	10.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  698.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
